{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Read one section across companies"},"description":"Use when someone asks what several companies say in the same section of their latest filing of one form, such as the risk factors in the latest 10-K of each company in a list. Takes up to 25 tickers or CIKs, a form and a section id. Returns, per company, a status (ok, unknown_ticker, no_filing, no_section or error), the filing id, dates and SEC source, and an excerpt of the section, with up to 24,000 characters shared across the companies and a flag that marks a cut. It needs a paid plan key and consumes one call per company.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"form":{"enum":["10-K","10-Q","8-K","10-K/A","10-Q/A","20-F","40-F"],"type":"string"},"max_characters":{"default":12000,"description":"Characters of section text in the whole reply, shared evenly across the companies found.","maximum":24000,"minimum":500,"type":"integer"},"section":{"description":"A section id such as item-1a, item-7 or item-1.","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,80}$","type":"string"},"tickers":{"description":"Tickers in EDGAR spelling (BRK-B; BRK.B and BRK/B also work), or CIKs such as 320193.","items":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9.\\/-]{1,13}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":25,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["tickers","form","section"],"type":"object"},"name":"read_section_across_companies","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"api_url":{"type":"string"},"calls":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"characters_per_company":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"count":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"details_dropped":{"type":"boolean"},"docs_url":{"type":"string"},"dup